<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span>! Let me in before someone sees!”</span> The scene is an intriguing one. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> stands blocking the door to his grandmother’s house as a boy about a year or so younger tries to get past him back inside. <span style="Color: Pink">The boy is wearing a large, striped shirt and, from what you can tell, no pants. The boy is holding the front of his shirt down to cover himself, though this unintentionally causes the back to lift up, giving you a good look at the boy’s butt, covered by only a cute pair of tighty whities.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’m serious! Let me in before I kick your butt!”</span> <br>
