Both boys argue back and forth until – <span style="Color: LightCoral">WHAM!</span> – <span style="Color: Yellow">a dark blur swats <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> hard in the butt, causing him to leap forward and say something in Spanish.</span> The boy laughs as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span>’s grandmother <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Rosita</span> walks out wielding a sandal. The boy’s laughter doesn’t last long, <span style="Color: Yellow">as he gets a few swats on the butt himself, leaving both boys rubbing their rears.</span> <br>

